  "extractionNotes": "Birth date: the ZUS memo examines the right on 2026-09-20 and both ZAMs start maternity on that day; a handwritten date one week earlier on the ZAM child field conflicts (likely an unshifted original). 2026-09-20 used. Base window printed as April-June 2026 (first full months of the title, before sickness from 2026-07-06; no recalculation for maternity). Monthly declared bases are on a missing memo page; 5652.00 (2026 minimum declared base) is inferred because 5652.00 x 0.8629 = 4877.11 exactly. The sickness benefit period printed in the memo overlaps the first 5 maternity days; ZUS offset it in the first payment (lump sum lower than the two rows). Benefit type is redacted on the memo. Second ZAM lists the whole 52 weeks under maternity; the first ZAM split is used as the plan. Payments printed only for Sep-Oct 2026, so durations are inferred."
